# Purpose/owner: select the complete damengbackup protected recovery configuration.
# Type/units: absolute local file path; no units; required exactly once when this
# env-file is supplied; no default. Permitted: canonical readable private 0600
# single-link regular JSON file, with validated format_version=1 and every policy.
# Secret handling: this reference is not a password; JSON contains password_file
# references only. Never place credential bytes, connection strings or keys here.
# Precedence/mapping: LoadConfiguration(baseFile, environmentFile) validates the
# base file, then this sole key selects a complete independently validated file.
# No ambient environment reads. Unknown/duplicate/empty/quoted keys are rejected.
# Restart/reload: loaded once per explicit operator invocation; no live reload.
# Integration: the central server/Compose/Helm recovery selector is not connected
# by this package. Pass this file explicitly to the owning loader after wiring.
PROJECT_ONE_DAMENG_RECOVERY_CONFIGURATION_FILE=/opt/projectone/private/dameng-recovery.json
